# Pages under docs/ and specs/ that lack the part docs/file-structure.md
# requires of their tier, named here so tools/lint-learned.d/doc-filing.sh
# does not report them. A docs/ entry lacks its "## Scope" section. A specs/
# entry lacks its frontmatter description.
#
# The list only shrinks. A listed page that gains its part is a finding until
# its line is deleted. tools/lint-learned.d.test.sh fails a line that names no
# page, or names one outside the set this list started as. Writing a docs/
# page's Scope charters the page, a human editorial act. A specs/ entry needs
# only its description written.

